WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.467
-Vladimir Putin once again
threatened the world

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:04.701
by climbing Russia was
not bluffing

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.367
with its threat to use
nuclear weapons

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.000
in its brutal war
against Ukraine,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.067
a threat that prompted
Donald Trump to once again

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.667
say something totally insane
and incoherent.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:14.534
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.300
♪♪

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:21.667
Russia's invasion of Ukraine
has been going terribly

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.968
for Russia recently,

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.434
with Ukrainian forces
pushing back Russian troops

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.801
and regaining control
of large swaths of territory,

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:30.267
so now that Putin is backed
into a corner,

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.300
he's threatening once again
to look inward

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.868
and see how he can change

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:35.734
to become not just
a better leader,

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:36.834
but also a better man.

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:38.200
Oh, wait. Nope. Sorry.
Read that wrong.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.334
He's threatening once again
to trigger a nuclear war.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:43.367
-Vladimir Putin announces
a major escalation

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:46.200
in his totally unprovoked
invasion of Ukraine,

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.567
the Russian president calling up
300,000 military reservists

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:53.734
and threatening to use
nuclear weapons.

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:57.100
-Vladimir Putin doubling down in
his war against Ukraine,

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.734
in a national address,
ordering up more troops

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.400
after a series of setbacks

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.100
and vowing Russia will use
"all means at its disposal"

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.067
and he added,
"I am not bluffing."

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.634
-Okay,
the problem with Putin is,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.334
even if he was bluffing,
it would be impossible to tell.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:15.501
The guy is a former KGB agent
and he's addicted to Botox.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:16.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:18.367
His expression never changes.

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:20.133
It doesn't matter if
he's losing a war

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:22.334
or riding a roller coaster.

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:23.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.601
He wouldn't even crack a smile

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:26.334
if Paul Hollywood
shook his hand!

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:27.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.434
[ Imitating Putin ]
"I'm this week's Star Baker.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:32.367
Thank you. I feel nothing."

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:33.767
I mean, I can't think
of a single thing

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.734
that would make one
of the world's most evil

00:01:35.734 --> 00:01:36.801
and dangerous men smile.

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.033
Oh, right.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:40.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:41.501
Like, in all seriousness,

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.834
can you imagine this guy
ever telling a joke?

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:45.300
You know how presidents
here in the US

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.467
have to do jokes every year

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:47.701
at the White House
Correspondent's Dinner?

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.567
Well, except for Trump,
who refused to do it,

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:52.033
because he got teased one year
by some dumb young kid

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:53.901
who didn't know any better
and then,

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:55.133
you know, ran for president.

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:57.467
You remember
M.C. Butterfly Effect over here.

00:01:57.467 --> 00:02:01.467
Anyway, imagine if Putin
had to do that in Russia.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:04.300
[ Imitating Putin ] "They say
war in Ukraine is going badly.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.634
Almost as badly
as press tour for

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.234
'Don't Worry, Darling.'

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:15.901
If you laughed at that joke,
you will be poisoned.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:17.501
And it is the worst
kind of poison,

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.801
because Harry Styles
spit in it.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:27.534
Chris Pine knows
what I'm talking about."

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:28.868
[ Normal voice ]
World leaders are reportedly

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:31.067
making contingency plans
in response to Putin's threat,

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:33.567
as well as communicating
in private with Moscow

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:35.467
about just how bad
an idea that would be.

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.434
-We have communicated directly,

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:40.901
privately at very high levels
to the Kremlin

00:02:40.901 --> 00:02:43.667
that any use of nuclear weapons
will be met

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:46.567
with catastrophic consequences
for Russia,

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:49.701
that the United States and our
allies will respond decisively,

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:51.601
and we have been
clear and specific

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:53.400
about what that will entail.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.200
-We have communicated
to the Russians

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.701
what the consequences
would be,

00:02:56.701 --> 00:02:59.234
but we've been careful in how
we talk about this publicly,

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.968
because from our perspective,

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:02.534
we want to lay down
the principle

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:04.868
that there would be
catastrophic consequences,

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:08.000
but not engage in a game
of rhetorical tit-for-tat.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.100
-I guess it's at least
a relief to hear that,

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:13.834
after four years of nonstop tat
from the world's biggest tit.

00:03:13.834 --> 00:03:16.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.367 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Applause ]

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.501
So as Russia loses more ground,

00:03:24.501 --> 00:03:25.901
Putin and some
of his top officials

00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:28.167
have been threatening to use
weapons of mass destruction.

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.133
And it's been a deeply
revealing study in contrast

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:32.100
to see how different
the reactions have been

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.567
from Joe Biden and Donald Trump.

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:36.701
First, there was Biden, who was
asked about the possibility

00:03:36.701 --> 00:03:39.734
that Putin might use nukes on
"60 Minutes" earlier this month,

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:41.567
and adopted a very sober tone.

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:44.968
-As Ukraine succeeds
on the battlefield,

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:47.367
Vladimir Putin
is becoming embarrassed

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:50.067
and pushed into a corner.

00:03:50.067 --> 00:03:51.834
And I wonder, Mr. President,

00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:54.901
what you would say to him
if he is considering

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:58.367
using chemical
or tactical nuclear weapons.

00:03:58.367 --> 00:04:00.767
-Don't.

00:04:00.767 --> 00:04:03.467
Don't. Don't.

00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:05.334
-I like when Biden treats
a world leader

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:09.200
like his dog Major threatening
to bite a Secret Service agent.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.701
"Major, don't!

00:04:10.701 --> 00:04:13.601
Don't do it, Major.

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:16.434
Damn it, Major!

00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:18.400
Now, I got to send you
back to Scranton,

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.234
and I'm cutting you off
financially.

00:04:21.234 --> 00:04:24.834
You'll have to go back
to tending bar."

00:04:24.834 --> 00:04:26.634
Anyway, Biden continued
from there,

00:04:26.634 --> 00:04:28.701
but he just didn't reveal
many details.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:32.167
-It would change the face of war
unlike anything

00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.300
since World War Two.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.667
-And the consequences of that
would be what?

00:04:36.667 --> 00:04:39.501
What would the U.S. response be?

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:42.100
-You think I would tell you if I
knew exactly what it would be?

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.567
Of course I'm not
going to tell you.

00:04:43.567 --> 00:04:45.334
-Okay, but could you
tell us a little?

00:04:45.334 --> 00:04:49.200
I would just love to know
if I need to start reinforcing

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.534
my desk with concrete
so I can use it as a bunker.

00:04:51.534 --> 00:04:53.300
Because right now
all I have is my attic,

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:54.634
and that place
is filled with wasps.

00:04:54.634 --> 00:04:57.534
Plus, I've been told
by many a YouTube commenter

00:04:57.534 --> 00:04:59.601
that the lighting for my
home shows made me look like,

00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:04.200
"young crypt keeper
or old Loki."

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.200
So Biden has been
stern but quiet

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.601
about how the US would respond.

00:05:08.601 --> 00:05:10.901
Trump, meanwhile, has been
speculating wildly at rallies

00:05:10.901 --> 00:05:13.801
and other events about insane
ideas like bombing Russia,

00:05:13.801 --> 00:05:16.434
but blaming it on China
by putting Chinese flags

00:05:16.434 --> 00:05:17.934
on a US fighter jets.

00:05:17.934 --> 00:05:19.300
That's a real thing
he actually said.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.801
It's one step removed
from Bugs Bunny

00:05:21.801 --> 00:05:25.067
dressing up as a lady
to trick Elmer Fudd.

00:05:25.067 --> 00:05:26.334
[ Imitating Trump ]
"Poor Elmer Fudd.

00:05:26.334 --> 00:05:29.067
He had such a boner
for the ladies that when...

00:05:29.067 --> 00:05:31.067
when he saw one
with pretty red lipstick,

00:05:31.067 --> 00:05:34.000
he ignored the whiskers
and the buck teeth.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.000
It wasn't until he saw the
cotton tail that he realized,

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.334
'Elmer, you've done it,
you've done it again, Elmer.

00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:43.534
You've -- You've tried
to have sex with a rabbit.'"

00:05:43.534 --> 00:05:46.167
And then this weekend
at a rally in North Carolina,

00:05:46.167 --> 00:05:48.601
he brought up the topic of
nuclear weapons

00:05:48.601 --> 00:05:52.200
in the weirdest and most
uncomfortable way possible.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.067
-You know,
Putin mentioned the N-word.

00:05:55.067 --> 00:05:56.667
You know what the N-word is?

00:05:56.667 --> 00:05:58.033
-Now...

00:05:58.033 --> 00:05:59.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.467 --> 00:06:01.234
...I have to imagine

00:06:01.234 --> 00:06:02.968
there was some percentage
of that crowd,

00:06:02.968 --> 00:06:04.200
however large or small,

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.834
that heard that sentence
and thought to themselves,

00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:11.634
"Oh, my God,
it's finally happening!"

00:06:11.634 --> 00:06:13.634
Meanwhile,
Biden was probably watching

00:06:13.634 --> 00:06:14.801
that like this --

00:06:14.801 --> 00:06:17.000
-The N-word! You know
what the N-word is?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.100
-Don't.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.834
Don't. Don't.

00:06:21.834 --> 00:06:24.968
-And to be fair,
it seems like Trump sensed

00:06:24.968 --> 00:06:26.367
what his crowd
was thinking, too,

00:06:26.367 --> 00:06:28.601
because he quickly
had to clarify himself.

00:06:28.601 --> 00:06:30.601
-You know what the N-word is?
It's --

00:06:30.601 --> 00:06:31.901
No, no, no.

00:06:31.901 --> 00:06:33.834
It's the "nuclear" word.

00:06:33.834 --> 00:06:35.534
He mentioned
the N-word yesterday.

00:06:35.534 --> 00:06:38.434
The nuclear word,
not supposed to be mentioned.

00:06:38.434 --> 00:06:40.167
You could end up
in World War Three.

00:06:40.167 --> 00:06:42.601
And this will be a war
like we've never had before.

00:06:42.601 --> 00:06:43.834
It won't even be close,

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:46.167
because we're being
run by stupid people.

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:48.834
-Yeah, you know, stupid people,
like the kinds of people

00:06:48.834 --> 00:06:50.300
who are refer to
the word "nuclear"

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.734
as "the N-word."

00:06:51.734 --> 00:06:53.133
What's wrong with you?

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:56.567
Why would you shorten a word
no one shortens like that?

00:06:56.567 --> 00:06:59.601
"You know, honey, I have to say,
your sister is a real C-word.

00:06:59.601 --> 00:07:02.434
That's right.
She's a real charmer."

00:07:02.434 --> 00:07:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.901 --> 00:07:10.968
Maybe he shortened it
because it's easier

00:07:10.968 --> 00:07:13.667
than saying the word nuclear,
because at this rally,

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:15.767
there were times
when he clearly had trouble

00:07:15.767 --> 00:07:17.334
getting any words
out of his mouth,

00:07:17.334 --> 00:07:18.968
as evidenced
by whatever the hell

00:07:18.968 --> 00:07:20.400
he was trying to say here.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.167
-Our once-great country --

00:07:23.167 --> 00:07:25.067
Remember, I was going to say,

00:07:25.067 --> 00:07:26.801
I was gonna use an expression,

00:07:26.801 --> 00:07:29.400
we have to keep
our country great --

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.667
but it's not -- I mean,

00:07:30.667 --> 00:07:33.701
for some reason,
it's just not great anymore.

00:07:33.701 --> 00:07:35.701
-I love that famous expression.

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:37.601
Very...

00:07:37.601 --> 00:07:39.300
Did you crib that
from Winston Churchill?

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.767
You should put that on a hat.

00:07:41.767 --> 00:07:43.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.934 --> 00:07:45.133
What happened to him there?

00:07:45.133 --> 00:07:46.934
I would say he lost his place
in his script,

00:07:46.934 --> 00:07:48.667
but he never follows
one to begin with.

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:51.200
It's also, I like when Trump
gets so confused,

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:54.834
he can't even find his way back
to one of his standard lines.

00:07:54.834 --> 00:07:56.234
Like if you're really that lost,

00:07:56.234 --> 00:07:58.734
just toss in a "crooked Hillary"
or a "lock her up" or something.

00:07:58.734 --> 00:08:00.901
Instead, he turned into
Ralph Kramden.

00:08:00.901 --> 00:08:02.734
"It's not I mean,
for some reason --

00:08:02.734 --> 00:08:04.300
hummina-hummina-hummina."

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.901
By the way, we did
a "Honeymooners" joke last week,

00:08:06.901 --> 00:08:08.701
and the audience went
as dead silent

00:08:08.701 --> 00:08:10.501
is when Trump said
the phrase "the N-word."

00:08:10.501 --> 00:08:12.934
And yet tonight, we decided
to call it back in a new segment

00:08:12.934 --> 00:08:15.200
we've dubbed "Seth Doubles Down
on a Stinker."

00:08:15.767 --> 00:08:18.133
-Hardy-har-har.

00:08:19.968 --> 00:08:21.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:23.400
Also, when it comes
to nuclear war,

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.300
I'm not sure we should be
taking advice from a guy

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.767
who stole highly sensitive,
classified documents

00:08:27.767 --> 00:08:29.567
about a foreign country's
nuclear capabilities

00:08:29.567 --> 00:08:30.667
and stashed them away

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:32.534
at his private beach club,
Mar-a-Lago.

00:08:32.534 --> 00:08:33.634
I'm guessing they were just

00:08:33.634 --> 00:08:35.767
laid out in tiny dishes
around his office

00:08:35.767 --> 00:08:37.701
the way my grandmother
put out hard candies.

00:08:37.701 --> 00:08:40.667
And by that, I mean
on every possible surface.

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.434
She loved a hard candy,
my grandmother.

00:08:42.434 --> 00:08:44.634
Used to walk
into the candy shop and say,

00:08:44.634 --> 00:08:45.934
"Give me something sweet
that's harder than

00:08:45.934 --> 00:08:47.734
living through the Depression."

00:08:47.734 --> 00:08:49.434
Now, as we told you last week,

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:51.767
an appeals court ruled that the
federal criminal investigation

00:08:51.767 --> 00:08:53.901
into Trump's handling of those
documents can move forward.

00:08:53.901 --> 00:08:56.667
And yet, oddly, there's only
one current or former president

00:08:56.667 --> 00:08:59.000
Republicans seem focused
on impeaching, and it's not

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.667
the one facing multiple criminal
investigations and civil suits

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:04.501
he stole classified documents
from the White House

00:09:04.501 --> 00:09:08.400
and fomented a violent coup
to overthrow American democracy.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.467
-Congresswoman Nancy Mace
believes there is pressure

00:09:11.467 --> 00:09:14.834
on House Republicans to try
and impeach President Joe Biden

00:09:14.834 --> 00:09:17.200
if they take control
after the midterms.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.834
-Do you expect

00:09:18.834 --> 00:09:20.767
an impeachment vote
against President Biden

00:09:20.767 --> 00:09:24.467
if Republicans take
over the House?

00:09:24.467 --> 00:09:27.100
-I believe there's a lot
of pressure on Republicans

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.534
to have that vote,

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:30.968
to put that legislation
forward and to have that vote.

00:09:30.968 --> 00:09:34.701
I think that is something
that some folks are considering.

00:09:34.701 --> 00:09:36.167
-These people are so crazy.

00:09:36.167 --> 00:09:37.968
The guy you support can't even
complete a full sentence.

00:09:37.968 --> 00:09:39.667
In fact, I'm pretty sure
if you asked Republicans

00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:42.834
what specifically they want to
impeach Biden for, they'd say --

00:09:42.834 --> 00:09:46.634
-Gate -- buh-buh.
But it's not...I mean...

00:09:46.634 --> 00:09:48.767
-I mean, what are you
going to impeach him for?

00:09:48.767 --> 00:09:51.467
Not stealing
classified documents?

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:53.901
Wearing sunglasses inside?

00:09:53.901 --> 00:09:55.801
Doing that thing where
he occasionally looks like

00:09:55.801 --> 00:10:00.200
he's not sure where to stand and
just kind of get stuck on stage?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.133
Look, it's funny, okay?

00:10:02.133 --> 00:10:04.334
It's funny,
and it happens to all of us.

00:10:04.334 --> 00:10:06.868
One time I got so lost
in the Mall of America,

00:10:06.868 --> 00:10:08.667
I ended up just moving there
and getting a job

00:10:08.667 --> 00:10:10.701
as an LL Bean mannequin.

00:10:10.701 --> 00:10:12.300
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.701
This is how badly
the Republican Party

00:10:13.701 --> 00:10:15.901
has degraded the institutions
of our government.

00:10:15.901 --> 00:10:18.801
They see power purely as a means
to reward themselves

00:10:18.801 --> 00:10:20.200
and punish their enemies,

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.367
even in the midst
of major global crises

00:10:22.367 --> 00:10:25.033
that should inspire
bipartisan cooperation.

00:10:25.033 --> 00:10:27.133
Republicans want to impeach
Joe Biden for no reason,

00:10:27.133 --> 00:10:28.934
but if you ask them
to hold Trump accountable,

00:10:28.934 --> 00:10:30.467
even just a little bit,
they'd say --

